  "shared_mechanics": [
    "Worlds freezes actual exile results after one simultaneous effective-creature battlefield movement. Only exact nontoken arrivals in exile are later returned to owner hands.",
    "Each player makes a private any-number creature-card selection in APNAP order using the existing ChooseHandCard action; identities remain hidden until one central EntryMove vector commits. Committed face-down selection counts become public under CR101.4/101.4a and survive entry choices.",
    "Ordinary EntryMove handles current owner control, choices and replacement pauses. It is compatible with Tony's separately authored optional attachment completion: no duplicate callback/batch framework or cross-worktree modification.",
    "Black Widow uses the actual captured damaged player, exiles until the first actual nonland exile, then offers the exact live source counter cost. Decline or departed source grants ordinary spell-only any-type mana permission for that exact exile incarnation until cleanup.",
    "Optional counter acceptance follows CR118.12, so counter replacement changes do not switch to the declined branch. Counters use the central replacement executor and captured ability controller as placer."
  ],
  "wire": {
    "schema": 152,
    "public_deltas": [
      "ExilePlayPermission.cast_only:bool, serde-skipped false; older permission wire shape remains unchanged when absent.",
      "HandChoiceKind::DeployCreatures within the existing actor-only hand_choice view.",
      "Optional Observation.hand_deployment exposes only APNAP actor and completed per-player selection counts, not selected identities. Omitted outside this operation."
    ],
    "actions": "No new Action: reuse ChooseHandCard(Some exact ref) and None to commit each optional hand selection.",
    "policy": "No policy changes; same existing action score arms.",
    "private_state": "Owned HandDeployment in cold ChoiceState. Selected refs move into central entry state; public committed counts remain through entry pauses.",
    "schema_note": "Same coordinated unpublished152 allocation, no153. No new accepted Trace table."
  },
