  "development_history": [
    "Two compile-only test fixture API corrections: CreatureType::from_name rather than an enum member; existing copy choice phase is Retarget. Runtime compiled afterward.",
    "First executable27-group matrix passed25; two failures were fixture flow assumptions. A no-target damage trigger can already be on stack after prepare_triggers; a no-target spell copy commits without a retarget menu. Corrected test capture/pumping only.",
    "Gated27 matrix then passed. After enabling both cards and metadata-only linking, removed all gated fixture fallbacks; actual supported28 plus27 affected regressions passed.",
    "Added the completed selection-count public view under CR101.4a and both-view assertions through entry choice. Same final55 tests passed with all inputs fixed."
  ],
  "test_precision": [
    "Actual paid Worlds copied by supported Choreographed Sparks has a distinct physical spell-copy object and independent exile/entry/return transaction. The no-target copy needs no retarget menu.",
